        "original_id": "6ec98b9e-8e7d-56a7-b756-84c9f1a5b81b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: 28th Test and Evaluation Squadron, 53d Wing, United States Air Force\n- Places: Eglin Air Force Base, Valparaiso, Florida, Okaloosa County\n\nFacts:\n- The 28th Test and Evaluation Squadron is an active unit of the United States Air Force.\n- The 28th Test and Evaluation Squadron is currently assigned to the 53d Wing.\n- The 53d Wing is based at Eglin Air Force Base in Florida.\n- Eglin Air Force Base is a United States Air Force base located about 3 miles southwest of Valparaiso in Okaloosa County, Florida.\n- Eglin Air Force Base uses the codes IATA VPS, ICAO KVPS, and FAA LID VPS.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
